    "long_instructions": "# Match the Image Reflection\r\n\r\n🤔 Take a minute to reflect on the last level where you were tasked with applying Flexbox child properties to match the image and answer the following questions:\r\n\r\n1. ✔️ How do you think you did according to the Rubric below and why?\r\n2. 🏁 How did you know how to complete this assessment?\r\n3. 👍🏼 What was easy about the task? / ❗ What was the most challenging? \r\n   - What did you do to overcome the challenging part?\r\n4. ❓ What questions do you still have?\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n::: details [Extensive Evidence]\r\nAdded an `order` property to child paragraphs and images to match the layout of the image in the instructions. Added an `align-self` property to paragraphs to match the image in the instructions. Added a `flex-grow` property to paragraph(s) to match the image in the instructions.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n::: details [Convincing Evidence]\r\nAdded `order`, `align-self`, and `flex-grow` properties to child paragraphs and images but the result does not exactly match the image in the instructions.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n::: details [Limited Evidence]\r\nAdded either `order`, `align-self`, or `flex-grow` properties to child paragraphs and/or images, but not all of the needed properties to match the image in the instructions.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n::: details [No Evidence]\r\nThere are no `order`, `align-self`, or `flex-grow` properties added for child paragraphs or images in order to match the image in the instructions.\r\n:::",
